    "输入 $0.030/百万 · 100 万上下文 · 最便宜": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "$0.030 per million in · 1M context · the cheapest"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入 $0.030/百万 · 100 万上下文 · 最便宜"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "输入 $0.075/百万 · 131 万上下文 · 综合最稳": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "$0.075 per million in · 1.31M context · the most dependable all-rounder"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入 $0.075/百万 · 131 万上下文 · 综合最稳"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "还没开的是 %@；": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "not yet enabled: %@; "
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没开的是 %@；"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "还没有填 API Key。请在设置里填写后再提问。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No API key yet. Add one in Settings before asking."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有填 API Key。请在设置里填写后再提问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "还没有对话。直接在下面提问就会自动建一个。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No conversations yet. Just ask below and one will be created."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有对话。直接在下面提问就会自动建一个。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "还没有屏幕录制权限，本次没有截图。请到「系统设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 屏幕录制」勾选 Wisp。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No Screen Recording permission yet, so nothing was captured. Enable Wisp under System Settings → Privacy & Security → Screen Recording."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有屏幕录制权限，本次没有截图。请到「系统设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 屏幕录制」勾选 Wisp。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这一轮附了截图": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A screenshot was attached this turn"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这一轮附了截图"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这个对话已经到 %lld 轮上限。新建一个，或删掉一个旧对话腾位置。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This conversation has reached its %lld-turn limit. Start a new one, or delete an old one to make room."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个对话已经到 %lld 轮上限。新建一个，或删掉一个旧对话腾位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这个开关每个浏览器配置文件要各开一次：切到该配置文件的窗口，菜单栏「View → Developer → Allow JavaScript from Apple Events」。没开的配置文件只能读到网址和截图。Safari 在「Develop」菜单里，且不分配置文件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This switch must be enabled once per browser profile: switch to a window of that profile, then choose View → Developer → Allow JavaScript from Apple Events. Profiles without it yield only the URL and the screenshot. Safari keeps it in the Develop menu and does not split it by profile."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个开关每个浏览器配置文件要各开一次：切到该配置文件的窗口，菜单栏「View → Developer → Allow JavaScript from Apple Events」。没开的配置文件只能读到网址和截图。Safari 在「Develop」菜单里，且不分配置文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这个模型或网关不接受图片输入。%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This model or gateway does not accept image input. %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个模型或网关不接受图片输入。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这份对话记录来自更新版本的 Wisp（格式 v%lld，本版本只认到 v%lld）。为了不覆盖它，本次运行不会保存任何改动。请升级 Wisp，或在设置里把它备份后重新开始。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This conversation file comes from a newer version of Wisp (format v%1$lld; this version only understands v%2$lld). To avoid overwriting it, nothing will be saved during this run. Update Wisp, or archive the file from Settings and start fresh."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这份对话记录来自更新版本的 Wisp（格式 v%1$lld，本版本只认到 v%2$lld）。为了不覆盖它，本次运行不会保存任何改动。请升级 Wisp，或在设置里把它备份后重新开始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "连不上这个地址。检查 Base URL 和端口，以及对方服务是否在运行。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Could not connect to this address. Check the Base URL and port, and whether the service is running."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连不上这个地址。检查 Base URL 和端口，以及对方服务是否在运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "连接正常，这个模型接受图片输入。配置已保存。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connected, and this model accepts image input. Settings saved."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接正常，这个模型接受图片输入。配置已保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
